, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§12.4 and §13.1, pp. 300–302, 320–324; local asymptotic class notation"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{TIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a>；函数参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^k}\">\\(2^{n^k}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto2^{n^k}\">\\(n\\mapsto2^{n^k}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EXPTIME}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TIME}(n\\mapsto2^{n^k})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EXPTIME}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TIME}(n\\mapsto2^{n^k})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TIME}$ 见 [[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]；函数参数 $2^{n^k}$ 表示 $n\\mapsto2^{n^k}$，$0^0=1$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TIME}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto2^{n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EXPTIME}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TIME}(n\\mapsto2^{n^k})","display":true}],"bytes":1460,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-exptime-notation|exptime notation]]"},{"id":"e452239d1f453972","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm P,\\mathrm{NP},\\mathrm{PSPACE},\\mathrm{EXPTIME}$ 分别见 [[73-df-p-notation]]、[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-pspace-notation]]、[[73-df-exptime-notation]]；全部采用二进制词语言载体。"}],"outgoing":["995085b8741b47ae"]}